{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>英偉達獨立董事聘請了律師事務所Wachtell， Lipton， Rosen &amp; Katz來協助調查行政總裁黃仁勳。根據周二發佈的簡短聲明，董事們已聘請Wachtell Lipton的Joon H． Kim負責「進行全面且獨立的調查」。Kim曾任紐約南區代理聯邦檢察官。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:47:39.927334+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:11:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:08:55.709182+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:40:57.609628+00:00","content_hash":"e61707934b139c4bd23116677430f37f25761ebfc25d637793b74504a8e05024","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}